You are assisting Eduardo with a theological study project called {NOME_DO_ESTUDO}.

# LANGUAGE AND TONE

- Language: Portuguese (Brazil) with perfect accentuation (á, é, í, ó, ú, ã, õ, â, ê, î, ô, û, à, ç)
- Tone: Academic, respectful, accessible
- User name: Eduardo

# PROJECT STRUCTURE

This project follows TEMPLATE_ESTUDO structure:

```
{NOME_DO_PROJETO}/
├── estudo/              ← Main content (chapters)
├── decks/               ← Mira animated slides
├── estudo_dirigido/     ← Study plans
├── docs/                ← Documentation and references
├── mira-templates/      ← Mira templates
└── plano-template-estudo/ ← Planning templates
```

# CRITICAL RULES

## File Editing Rules

1. NEVER edit *_EN.md files (original English content)
2. NEVER edit *_PT.md files (preserved translations)
3. ONLY edit *_PT_v1.md files (corrected versions)

## Chapter Format (_PT_v1.md)

Each chapter in estudo/capitulo_XX/ follows this structure:

```markdown
# Título do Capítulo em Português

> **Capítulo N** — Título Original em Inglês

## Perguntas centrais

- q1. Pergunta 1?
- q2. Pergunta 2?
- q3. Pergunta 3?

## I. Explicação e Base Bíblica

### A. Primeira seção principal

#### 1. Subseção

Conteúdo...

> **Definição**: Termo teológico em blockquote

## Notas

[^1]: Nota de rodapé
```

# BIBLE ABBREVIATIONS (Portuguese)

Always use Portuguese abbreviations:

## Old Testament
Gn, Êx, Lv, Nm, Dt, Js, Jz, Rt, 1Sm, 2Sm, 1Rs, 2Rs, 1Cr, 2Cr, Ed, Ne, Et, Jó, Sl, Pv, Ec, Ct, Is, Jr, Lm, Ez, Dn, Os, Jl, Am, Ob, Jn, Mq, Na, Hc, Sf, Ag, Zc, Ml

## New Testament
Mt, Mc, Lc, Jo, At, Rm, 1Co, 2Co, Gl, Ef, Fp, Cl, 1Ts, 2Ts, 1Tm, 2Tm, Tt, Fm, Hb, Tg, 1Pe, 2Pe, 1Jo, 2Jo, 3Jo, Jd, Ap

# MIRA (ANIMATED SLIDES)

## Pipeline

1. /mira-extract → Extract chapter content
2. /mira-planner → Plan slide structure
3. /mira-copywriter → Refine slide texts
4. /mira-builder → Build HTML slides
5. /mira-animator → Add D3.js animations
6. /mira-validator → Validate generated slides

## Animation Rules

- ALL animations must enter with choreography AND THEN continue in internal loop
- Static animation is FORBIDDEN
- Always use CSS theme variables: var(--mira-primary), var(--mira-secondary), etc.
- Default theme: mira-dark

## Slide Structure

```html
<div class="mira-card">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 class="card-title">Título do Slide</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-canvas">
    <svg id="animacao"></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="card-base">
    <p class="card-description">Descrição ou legenda</p>
    <div class="card-pills">
      <span class="pill">Pílula 1</span>
      <span class="pill">Pílula 2</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```

# STUDY PLANS (estudo_dirigido/)

## 6-Stage Structure

Each study plan must include:

1. **🔥 Stage 1 — Warm-up**: 3 trigger questions (before reading)
2. **📖 Stage 2 — Guided reading**: Focused readings
3. **🧠 Stage 3 — Key concepts**: Definitions to memorize
4. **✍️ Stage 4 — Understanding test**: Objective and essay questions
5. **💭 Stage 5 — Personal reflection**: Life application
6. **🏁 Stage 6 — Consolidation**: Synthesis and final traffic light

## Required Elements

- Checkboxes: `- [ ]`
- Answer spaces: `> _Resposta:_`
- Self-assessment rubric (0–5)
- Final traffic light: 🟢 mastered · 🟡 review · 🔴 reread
- Link to next chapter

# NAMING CONVENTIONS

## Chapter Folders
- Format: `capitulo_XX/` (XX = two digits, zero-padded)
- Examples: `capitulo_01/`, `capitulo_02/`, `capitulo_34/`

## Chapter Files
- `XX_Titulo_EN.md` — Original English (never edit)
- `XX_Titulo_PT.md` — Preserved translation (never edit)
- `XX_Titulo_PT_v1.md` — Corrected version (only edit this)

## Decks
- Folder format: `xx-nome-do-capitulo/` (kebab-case, zero-padded)
- Files: `index.html`, `briefing.md`, `plano-refinado.md`, `validacao.md`

# DOCUMENTATION (docs/)

## Subfolders

- `docs/diversos/` — General project documents
- `docs/referencias/` — Bibliographic references
- `docs/videos/` — Video links and metadata
- `docs/imagens/` — Figures and diagrams
- `docs/audios/` — Audio resources

